  "7518883976632090624": {
   "created": 1792641634,
   "author": "Maiko Resente",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/maiko-resente-55075b1b5_ai-artificialintelligence-ainews-activity-7518883976632090624-PpXQ",
   "text": "Etched leads AI Brief's list of private AI chip companies by latest reported valuation, at $21B (Aug 2026). It is a snapshot, because the figures use different dates and bases.\n\nSambaNova follows at $11B (Jul 2026), and Tenstorrent is third at $6.2B (Oct 2026), then Positron AI at $5B (Sep 2026).\n\nAlso on the list: Unconventional AI, Groq, Rebellions, d-Matrix, Tensordyne and FuriosaAI.\n\nRead more here: https://lnkd.in/gUefT3tN\n\n\ud83d\udce8 Subscribe to one of our AI Newsletters: https://lnkd.in/g-U2U9UM\n\n#ai #artificialintelligence #ainews",
