  "7519390348008255488": {
   "created": 1792762362,
   "author": "Best NanoTech",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/best-nanotech_indiasemiconductor-fabless-deeptech-activity-7519390348008255488-QxjH",
   "text": "THE SEMICONDUCTOR VC PLAYBOOK: WHAT AMERICA IS FUNDING \u2014 AND WHAT INDIA MUST BUILD NEXT\n\nThe winning product is no longer just a faster chip. Increasingly, it is a complete system:\nSilicon + Memory + Interconnect + Packaging + Software + Customers.\n\nGlobal semiconductor sales reached about $795.6B in 2025, and WSTS projects roughly $1.5T in 2026. U.S.-headquartered companies held 53.4% global market share and invested a record $76.8B in R&D. \n\nVC capital is following. U.S. semiconductor-related startups raised $6.2B in 2025, up 85% YoY. By the first five months of 2026, semiconductor startups globally had attracted about $10.7B. \n\nWHAT IS GETTING FUNDED?\n\u2192 AI inference & specialized accelera",
